	-- {zone:1446} Tanaris · {area:254} Blackrock Mountain · {area:976} Gadgetzan · {zone:1428} Burning Steppes · {zone:1451} Silithus · {zone:1452} Winterspring · {zone:1423} Eastern Plaguelands · {area:2279} Stratholme · {area:2577} Dire Maul · {area:1584} Blackrock Depths · {area:2057} Scholomance · {npc:16042} Lord Valthalak · {npc:230319} Deliana · {object:171709} High Seat
	["What the chain asks, so you can plan: about 30 quests from {zone:1446} to {area:254}. The first part is solo ({area:976}, the {zone:1428}, {zone:1451}, {zone:1452}, the {zone:1423}). Then come runs of {area:2279}, {area:2577}, {area:1584}, Lower and Upper Blackrock Spire and {area:2057}, a summoned Duke in {zone:1451}, two bosses your class's brazier calls, {npc:16042}, and elites in the open world: that part needs a group, and the guide asks before each quest of it. {npc:230319} stands in the {object:171709}, King Magni's throne room."] = "Ce que demande la chaîne, pour vous organiser : environ 30 quêtes de {zone:1446} à {area:254}. La première partie se fait seul ({area:976}, {zone:1428}, {zone:1451}, {zone:1452}, {zone:1423}). Viennent ensuite des passages à {area:2279}, {area:2577}, {area:1584}, au pic Rochenoire inférieur et supérieur et à {area:2057}, un Duc invoqué en {zone:1451}, deux boss appelés par le brasero de votre classe, {npc:16042}, et des élites en extérieur : cette partie demande un groupe, et le guide vous demande avant chacune de ses quêtes. {npc:230319} se tient dans {object:171709}, la salle du trône du roi Magni.",
